id: E14850-draft-2501_91199785
trigger_tool: cmake|qt5|conan
phase: configure|consumer-test
error_signature: "Qt CMake config references stale build prefix|fatal error: 'QMap' file not found|fatal error: 'GL/glu.h' file not found"
severity: 2
category: qt|cmake|transitive-headers
match_keywords: Qt5OpenGL, stale Qt CMake config, moc, uic, public Qt headers, transitive_headers, GLU, Mesa
title: A Qt SDK can contain working binaries but broken native configs and incomplete Conan public-header metadata
root_cause: >
  A published Qt package may contain real headers, shared libraries, moc and
  uic while its exported native CMake files still point at a former build
  prefix or omit an OpenGL component. Separately, a consumer's public headers
  include Qt and GLU headers, but Conan prunes those transitive include paths
  unless the recipe declares their public-header traits. Building the library
  alone does not expose either consumer contract error.
affected_scope: Qt/OpenGL libraries consuming imperfect prebuilt Conan Qt SDKs and exporting Qt or GLU types in public headers
verification_cmd: "probe the published SDK artifact and component inventory; build with exact package-local tools/libs; compile an installed CMakeDeps consumer through only the producer target on the OHOS target"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: bind-real-qt-artifacts-and-public-transitive-dependencies
rec_description: >
  If native Qt configs are stale, use a task-local build description bound to
  package-local moc/uic/headers/libs, without editing shared dependencies.
  Declare transitive_headers and transitive_libs for public dependencies and
  list direct dependencies in cpp_info.requires. Test the installed package;
  distinguish headless object construction from actual GPU rendering.
rec_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: "claim graphical rendering works because a headless QGLViewer object was constructed"
forbid_1_reason: offscreen consumer construction does not establish an OpenGL context or draw frames
similar_to: E581-draft-E32D
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/E14850-draft-2501_91199785.md
source_event: libqglviewer/2.9.1 target run libqglviewer-w3-20261003T195815Z; log sha256 fef8264d126e1a9f2faec289e991dba9971f585ea7a0b5ea23be19ca4b43a7a8
